# Phase 2: Operator Voice Output Mode

## Overview

Add `--voice operator` flag to stage0. Transforms verdict output from analyst report (tables, scores, tags) to mentor-style conversational guidance. Reads like a mentor at a coffee shop telling you exactly what to do, who to talk to, and what to say.

## Requirements

- Functional: New `--voice operator` flag in stage0 trigger
- Functional: Operator voice template replaces analyst template in Step 7
- Functional: Side-door paths (Phase 1) rendered in operator voice when flag active
- Functional: All data (Mountain Test, P10/P50/P90, sources) preserved but embedded in narrative
- Non-functional: Output ≤2000 words. Zero bullet lists. Zero tables. Zero technical headers.

## Architecture

```
Step 7 — Verdict Synthesis
    ├── voice_mode == "analyst" → existing template (tables, scores, tags)
    └── voice_mode == "operator" → new template:
        ├── SITUATION (2-3 sentences plain language)
        ├── VERDICT (1 sentence: mountain/kill/side-hustle)
        ├── THE MOVE (conversational paragraphs with scripts)
        ├── TIMELINE (week-by-week)
        ├── THE MATH (unit economics in narrative)
        └── SOURCES (URLs only)
```

